==Battleground==
*2 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*1 [[Fallen Bear]] spawns after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*2 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 2~4 seconds<sup>60f~120f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Le'Behemoth]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 23.33~30 seconds<sup>700f~900f</sup>.
**8 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn, delay 16.67~20 seconds<sup>500f~600f</sup>.
**2 [[Red EnerG]]s spawn, delay 33.33~36.67 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,100f</sup>.
**1 [[Hackey]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Aku Doge, while a peon, has the boosted stats to be a threat alongside the boosted Fallen Bear and Le'Behemoth, as stalling them can be a challenge. High-range [[:Category:Shield Piercing Cats|Shield Piercers]] such as [[Aku Researcher (Rare Cat)|Aku Researcher]] are almost necessary to ensure good damage and CC against the Aku enemies. However, the Red EnerG duo can push quite hard with a surge, so [[:Category:Cats with Surge Immunity|Surge-Immune units]] such as [[Boogie Cat (Special Cat)|Gato Amigo]] and [[Ancient Egg: N003 (Special Cat)|Cat Cactus]] help a lot. Other good stallers include [[Talents|Talented]] [[Matador Cat (Rare Cat)|Bellydancer Cat]], who has a chance to dodge every enemy here, and [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Stone Cat]]. The latter is more expensive and less spammable while having high HP against the Akus at a high level. Of course, speed and timing matter in this stage, as Hackey loves to snipe oncoming units.

Several Ubers work nicely in this stage. [[Summoner Satoru (Uber Rare Cat)|Summoner Satoru]] has a good chance to pierce shields with crowd control, especially in true form, and stays safe with Surge Immunity. For much the same reason, [[Hevijak the Wicked (Uber Rare Cat)|Hevijak]] works well in this stage, though the knockback chance without LD could push your own Cats into danger. Hevijak is not immune to surge but can still outrange Red EnerG and avoid these surges regardless. Other units with Shield Piercing or Surge Immunity work well in general.

